{"bundle_id":"search.fe773272cb599dd338fe","facts":[{"description":"The assessed actor is an intermediary that distributes SFC-authorised funds, within the distributor description in u1.; units: truth value","name":"is_distributor","type":"bool"},{"description":"The assessed promotion concerns an SFC-authorised fund or a particular type of SFC-authorised fund.; units: truth value","name":"is_authorised_fund_promotion","type":"bool"},{"description":"The actor offers the identified benefit to a client in the assessed promotion; delivery or acceptance is not required.; units: truth value","name":"benefit_offered_to_client","type":"bool"},{"description":"The identified benefit qualifies as a gift for the selected paragraph 3.11 control, before applying the discount exception; an incentive or guaranteed return does not establish this automatically.; units: truth value","name":"benefit_is_gift","type":"bool"},{"description":"The identified benefit itself qualifies as a discount of fees or charges within the stated exception.; units: truth value","name":"benefit_is_fee_discount","type":"bool"},{"description":"The benefit is offered in promoting a specific investment product or a particular investment-product type, including a type connection established by how the benefit is offered; examples include certain fund types or funds from certain fund houses.; units: truth value","name":"has_product_promotion_connection","type":"bool"}],"interpretations":[{"basis":"reviewer_interpretation","id":"reading","issue_ids":[],"source_span_ids":["s.u1","s.u14","s.u13","s.u29"],"statement":"Unreviewed interpretation: Selected control: paragraph-10 gift-offer restriction, general-product reading. For an intermediary distributing SFC-authorised funds, if the intermediary offers a client a benefit that qualifies as a gift, the benefit is not a discount of fees or charges, and its offer promotes a specific investment product or a particular investment-product type, the offer departs from the stated should-not-offer standard. A product-type connection includes the specified fund-category and fund-house connections. Structured-product status and proof of actual distraction are not prerequisites. Within scope, a true formal result flags that departure; a false result addresses only this selected benefit and control."}],"rules":[{"body":{"args":[{"name":"benefit_offered_to_client","node_id":"body.2","op":"fact"},{"name":"benefit_is_gift","node_id":"body.3","op":"fact"},{"arg":{"name":"benefit_is_fee_discount","node_id":"body.5","op":"fact"},"node_id":"body.4","op":"not"},{"name":"has_product_promotion_connection","node_id":"body.6","op":"fact"}],"node_id":"body.1","op":"all"},"id":"selected.control","interpretation_id":"reading","scope":{"name":"is_distributor","node_id":"scope.1","op":"fact"},"source_span_ids":["s.u1","s.u14","s.u13","s.u29"],"type":"bool"}],"source_spans":[{"end":495,"id":"s.u1","page":1,"quote_sha256":"442822b23173e6d22b345e0b971eda15bce33f0d1c452ec5421a39f69e59d410","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":2,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},{"end":3670,"id":"s.u14","page":1,"quote_sha256":"2a189f82f8c81185ca622db5cbe25628a25b490bc2f08c8db57b0079dfef8654","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":2987,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},{"end":2982,"id":"s.u13","page":1,"quote_sha256":"04a87fceacdbfbba3d3538d0ac0f646499312578dd7b41272307ade3f323b691","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc47c47de14c31303a5f430df9","source_id":"23EC46","start":2646,"text_sha256":"a1bb2e92c24fd0dce2e6fc73aa164bc7455ca672504a1ee86c180e9457f97f9e"},{"end":8108,"id":"s.u29","page":1,"quote_sha256":"4c6f6c26a269f1395844e4e68ad8b7b0dc9a752bf58521543258b9ca6360144b","raw_sha256":"517ea55a89069338cde4b0ed0d75226e09967afc4